<title>UK: London gold fixes easier, may slip further.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier, may slip further.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $324.35 vs $328.25 previously. Tuesday's rally sold into post Greenspan testimony to U.S. congress. Seen easing further to $321-$322 area.</p>
<p>SILVER - Easier with gold at $4.30/$4.32, down six cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $1.50 at $416.00/$419.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Very tight and followed through firmer New York in Tokyo. $201.00/$2104.00 up $3.50.</p>
</text>
